    "markdown": "---\ntitle: \"Player archetypes\"\n---\n\n\n\n\nSix style archetypes are fitted jointly on both leagues, with each feature measured relative to its own\nleague and season. Sub-types split each archetype further (e.g. *Alpha scorer*, *Floor general* and\n*Shot-making scorer* inside *On-ball creator*).\n\n![Average profile of each archetype (standard deviations from the league-season mean).](figures/step3_archetype_profiles.png)\n\n## How the mix has shifted\n\nShare of all minutes played by each archetype, by season.\n\n\n```{=html}\n<div>                            <div id=\"288963b6-1a14-47e4-8635-9a65ceadbb49\" class=\"plotly-graph-div\" style=\"height:430px; width:100%;\"></div>            <script type=\"text/javascript\">                                    window.PLOTLYENV=window.PLOTLYENV || {};                                    if (document.getElementById(\"288963b6-1a14-47e4-8635-9a65ceadbb49\")) {                    Plotly.newPlot(                        \"288963b6-1a14-47e4-8635-9a65ceadbb49\",                        [{\"hovertemplate\":\"Secondary guard: %{y:.0%}\\u003cextra\\u003e\\u003c\\u002fextra\\u003e\",\"legendgroup\":\"Secondary guard\",\"line\":{\"color\":\"#2a78d6\",\"width\":2},\"mode\":\"lines\",\"name\":\"Secondary guard\",\"showlegend\":true,\"x\":[2004,2005,2006,2007,2008,2009,2010,2011,2012,2013,2014,2015,2016,2017,2018,2019,2020,2021,2022,2023,2024,2025,2026],\"y\":[0.2244497799119648,0.2251763767147385,0.2553630391006909,0.2398809393755535,0.205991627067993,0.2143636488960544,0.1919672285525944,0.1869605935929489,0.2275668648388086,0.1837859376371826,0.1994459740670142,0.1953829954102016,0.1981880392440248,0.2064919650147736,0.2093571329903541,0.2341385918902562,0.1982806412068306,0.2271383716516958,0.2012412362524498,0.1926021394076469,0.1680184795427894,0.1857169538610126,0.2093117592899619],\"type\":\"scatter\",\"xaxis\":\"x\",\"yaxis\":\"y\"},{\"hovertemplate\":\"Connector forward: %{y:.0%}\\u003cextra\\u003e\\u003c\